                <pb facs="0769" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg719"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Department of
                                State</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-12-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 2,
                    1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>While appreciating Sultan’s confidence, President unwilling American be sent with
                    Turkish commissioner to investigate alleged atrocities.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
